# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to interpret the shaded lightcone visualizations"
msgstr "Cara mentafsir visualisasi shaded lightcone"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/interpreting-visualizations.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The package provides two ways to look at a shaded lightcone:\n"
msgstr "Pakej ini menyediakan dua cara untuk melihat shaded lightcone:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`draw_shaded_lightcone` overlays the bounds onto the circuit diagram. THis is best for circuits on a 1D\n"
"chain of qubits, where the circuit diagram and the physical layout agree.\n"
msgstr ""
"`draw_shaded_lightcone` melapiskan sempadan pada gambar rajah litar. Ini paling sesuai untuk litar pada rantai 1D\n"
"qubit, di mana gambar rajah litar dan susun atur fizikal sepadan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`animate_shaded_lightcone` projects the bounds onto the QPU's coupling map and steps through the\n"
"circuit layer by layer. This is best when the qubit connectivity is more than a 1D line, where a circuit\n"
"diagram stops conveying which qubits are neighbors.\n"
msgstr ""
"`animate_shaded_lightcone` memproyeksikan sempadan pada peta gandingan QPU dan melangkah melalui\n"
"litar lapisan demi lapisan. Ini paling sesuai apabila kesambungan qubit lebih daripada garis 1D, di mana gambar rajah\n"
"litar tidak lagi menyampaikan qubit mana yang berjiran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both visualizations show the same underlying numbers. This guide covers what those numbers mean, and explains the details\n"
"that are easy to misread.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kedua-dua visualisasi menunjukkan nombor asas yang sama. Panduan ini merangkumi maksud nombor tersebut, dan menerangkan butiran\n"
"yang mudah disalah baca.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "Persediaan {#setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the same Trotterized Ising circuit and observable as the [quickstart guide](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart).\n"
msgstr "Gunakan litar Ising Trotter dan observabel yang sama seperti [panduan permulaan pantas](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/quickstart).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`draw_shaded_lightcone` {#draw-shaded-lightcone}"
msgstr "`draw_shaded_lightcone` {#draw-shaded-lightcone}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each noisy box is shaded by the bound on the errors occurring there: bright means a large bound, and\n"
"a box fading into the background means its errors have little effect on the observable. Those faded\n"
"boxes are the candidates for dropping from the mitigated noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap kotak bising dilorekkan mengikut sempadan ralat yang berlaku di situ: cerah bermaksud sempadan besar, dan\n"
"kotak yang pudar ke latar belakang bermaksud ralatnya mempunyai kesan kecil terhadap observabel. Kotak\n"
"pudar itu ialah calon untuk digugurkan daripada model hingar yang dimitigasi.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/interpreting-visualizations/extracted-outputs/cell-04-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/interpreting-visualizations/extracted-outputs/cell-04-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Important notes {#important-notes}"
msgstr "Nota penting {#important-notes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**1. Each number is a sum over the error terms sharing a support.** Without a filter, the bounds of\n"
"every error term acting on the same qubit, or on the same pair of qubits, are added into one value:\n"
"all three Pauli types on a qubit, and all nine on a pair. That has two consequences. A value can\n"
"exceed 2.0, even though no single term's bound can (a box labelled `4.5` is several terms adding up,\n"
"not a violated bound). The figure cannot tell you whether a large value comes from one Pauli\n"
"type or from several comparable ones; the next section shows how to separate them.\n"
msgstr ""
"**1. Setiap nombor ialah hasil tambah ke atas sebutan ralat yang berkongsi sokongan.** Tanpa penapis, sempadan\n"
"setiap sebutan ralat yang bertindak pada qubit yang sama, atau pada pasangan qubit yang sama, ditambah menjadi satu nilai:\n"
"ketiga-tiga jenis Pauli pada satu qubit, dan kesemua sembilan pada satu pasangan. Itu mempunyai dua akibat. Nilai boleh\n"
"melebihi 2.0, walaupun tiada sempadan sebutan tunggal yang boleh (kotak berlabel `4.5` ialah beberapa sebutan yang ditambah,\n"
"bukan sempadan yang dilanggar). Rajah itu tidak dapat memberitahu anda sama ada nilai besar datang daripada satu jenis\n"
"Pauli atau daripada beberapa jenis yang setanding; bahagian seterusnya menunjukkan cara memisahkannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**2. The color scale starts at 2.0 and grows with the data.** The scale runs from 0 to the\n"
"`\"max_bound\"` entry of the overlaid circuit's metadata, which is the larger of 2.0 and the largest\n"
"value shown. Unfiltered sums often exceed 2.0, so the scale stretches to fit them, and the same\n"
"color can stand for different values in different figures. When every value is small, the\n"
"scale stays at 2.0 and everything looks uniformly dark (that is the scale reflecting the absolute\n"
"size, not a rendering fault).\n"
msgstr ""
"**2. Skala warna bermula pada 2.0 dan bertambah mengikut data.** Skala berjalan daripada 0 hingga entri\n"
"`\"max_bound\"` dalam metadata litar yang dilapiskan, iaitu yang lebih besar antara 2.0 dan nilai terbesar\n"
"yang ditunjukkan. Hasil tambah tanpa penapis sering melebihi 2.0, jadi skala melebar untuk memuatkannya, dan warna\n"
"yang sama boleh mewakili nilai yang berbeza dalam rajah yang berbeza. Apabila setiap nilai kecil,\n"
"skala kekal pada 2.0 dan semuanya kelihatan gelap seragam (itu skala yang mencerminkan saiz\n"
"mutlak, bukan kerosakan pemaparan).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separating the Pauli types {#separating-the-pauli-types}"
msgstr "Memisahkan jenis Pauli {#separating-the-pauli-types}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use `pauli_filter` to see one type at a time. An integer selects a Pauli weight; a string selects\n"
"a specific Pauli, matched against each noise term **reduced to its own non-identity support**. So\n"
"`\"X\"` selects every single-qubit $X$ error, regardless of which qubit it acts on, and `\"XX\"` selects the\n"
"weight-2 ones (a full-width label like `\"XII\"` matches nothing).\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan `pauli_filter` untuk melihat satu jenis pada satu masa. Integer memilih pemberat Pauli; rentetan memilih\n"
"Pauli tertentu, dipadankan dengan setiap sebutan hingar **dikurangkan kepada sokongan bukan identitinya sendiri**. Jadi\n"
"`\"X\"` memilih setiap ralat $X$ qubit tunggal, tidak kira qubit mana yang ditindaknya, dan `\"XX\"` memilih\n"
"yang berpemberat 2 (label lebar penuh seperti `\"XII\"` tidak memadankan apa-apa).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The unfiltered row is the sum of the three Pauli types below it. Filtering is the only way to tell\n"
"whether a large unfiltered value comes from one dominant error type or from several comparable ones.\n"
"That matters, because the mitigation acts per term, not per site.\n"
msgstr ""
"Baris tanpa penapis ialah hasil tambah ketiga-tiga jenis Pauli di bawahnya. Penapisan ialah satu-satunya cara untuk mengetahui\n"
"sama ada nilai besar tanpa penapis datang daripada satu jenis ralat dominan atau beberapa yang setanding.\n"
"Itu penting, kerana mitigasi bertindak mengikut sebutan, bukan mengikut tapak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Passing the same filter to `draw_shaded_lightcone` records it in the figure title, so a filtered\n"
"figure cannot be mistaken for an unfiltered one:\n"
msgstr ""
"Memasukkan penapis yang sama kepada `draw_shaded_lightcone` merekodkannya dalam tajuk rajah, supaya rajah\n"
"yang ditapis tidak boleh dikelirukan dengan yang tidak ditapis:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/interpreting-visualizations/extracted-outputs/cell-09-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/guides/interpreting-visualizations/extracted-outputs/cell-09-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This figure looks quite different from the unfiltered one above, and not only because it shows\n"
"fewer values. Each placeholder in these figures stands for one support: a single qubit, or a pair of\n"
"qubits. Without a filter, a box shows a placeholder on every qubit and on every pair of neighboring\n"
"qubits, so it spreads over several columns. With `\"X\"`, only the single-qubit supports remain, and\n"
"each box shrinks to a single column.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rajah ini kelihatan agak berbeza daripada yang tanpa penapis di atas, dan bukan hanya kerana ia menunjukkan\n"
"lebih sedikit nilai. Setiap pemegang tempat dalam rajah ini mewakili satu sokongan: satu qubit, atau sepasang\n"
"qubit. Tanpa penapis, kotak menunjukkan pemegang tempat pada setiap qubit dan pada setiap pasangan qubit\n"
"berjiran, jadi ia merentasi beberapa lajur. Dengan `\"X\"`, hanya sokongan qubit tunggal yang kekal, dan\n"
"setiap kotak mengecut menjadi satu lajur.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Neither picture shows what PEC actually applies though. The placeholders are a way to display\n"
"bounds, not anti-noise gates. During the experiment, every box whose error terms are mitigated is\n"
"treated as a single layer of two-qubit gates, and the anti-noise Paulis sampled for its error terms\n"
"are composed into one Pauli that is applied to that layer as a whole.\n"
msgstr ""
"Namun, kedua-dua gambar tidak menunjukkan apa yang sebenarnya digunakan oleh PEC. Pemegang tempat ialah cara untuk memaparkan\n"
"sempadan, bukan gate anti-hingar. Semasa eksperimen, setiap kotak yang terma ralatnya dimitigasi\n"
"diperlakukan sebagai satu lapisan gate dua-qubit, dan Pauli anti-hingar yang disampel untuk terma ralatnya\n"
"digubah menjadi satu Pauli yang dikenakan pada lapisan itu secara keseluruhan.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`animate_shaded_lightcone` {#animate-shaded-lightcone}"
msgstr "`animate_shaded_lightcone` {#animate-shaded-lightcone}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On a device whose connectivity is not a 1D line, a circuit diagram no longer shows which qubits are\n"
"neighbors, so the spatial spread of the lightcone becomes impossible to read.\n"
"`animate_shaded_lightcone` instead draws the QPU's coupling map and animates the bounds across it,\n"
"one noisy box per frame.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada peranti yang kesambungannya bukan garis 1D, rajah litar tidak lagi menunjukkan qubit mana yang\n"
"berjiran, jadi penyebaran ruang lightcone menjadi mustahil untuk dibaca.\n"
"`animate_shaded_lightcone` sebaliknya melukis peta gandingan QPU dan menganimasikan sempadan merentasinya,\n"
"satu kotak berhingar bagi setiap bingkai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It needs a `CouplingMap`, which it lays out on a grid by embedding the device graph, so it handles both\n"
"heavy-hex and square connectivity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ia memerlukan `CouplingMap`, yang disusun atur pada grid dengan membenamkan graf peranti, jadi ia menyokong kedua-dua\n"
"kesambungan heavy-hex dan segi empat sama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<div class=\"alert alert-info\">\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** In this rendered documentation the animation is static. The slider and play button only\n"
"work when the notebook runs interactively, for example in Jupyter.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nota:** Dalam dokumentasi yang dirender ini, animasi adalah statik. Peluncur dan butang main hanya\n"
"berfungsi apabila notebook dijalankan secara interaktif, contohnya dalam Jupyter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</div>\n"
msgstr ""

